  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 100eb (Premium) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>Folding legs have been a landmark of sharpshooters for over a century.</em></p>\n<p>As an Action, the user can deploy the bipod onto any piece of mostly flat Cover or go Prone to deploy it on the ground. While the bipod is deployed, the weapon is considered Mounted and provides a +1 bonus to all Attack Checks. While wielding a weapon with a deployed bipod, the user cannot make Move Actions or dodge Ranged Attacks.</p>\n<p>While deployed onto a piece of Cover, the user can still duck down behind the Cover, but the weapon remains visible wherever it is mounted. It does not take an Action to un-deploy the bipod. While this is equipped to a weapon, it cannot be concealed under clothing. This is not considered an Underbarrel Attachment.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deployed, the weapon counts as Mounted and gets +1 to all attacks (situational), but you can't take Move Actions or dodge Ranged Attacks.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Stabilizers &amp; Stocks).</em></p>"
